#
#   style_computer_6 - CSS::StyleComputer: computing an element's style
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleComputer.cpp (lines 1777-2239): the document's style,
#       compute_style and its seeded and pseudo-element variants, compute_style_impl (the
#       cascade, custom properties and the bail-outs for pseudo-elements), the monospace
#       font-size time travel (recascade_font_size_if_needed), compute_properties (inheritance,
#       initial values, logical properties, animations and the post-cascade adjustments) and
#       the :is()/:where() bucketing simplification.
